accTitle: "NutsNews Protected Ansible Apply Workflow"
accDescr: "This explains the first protected GitHub Actions workflow that can run the Ansible VPS baseline against `vps.nutsnews.com`. It is a product…"
flowchart TD
  A[workflow_dispatch triggered] --> B{Run mode}
  B -->|check| C[Dry-run Ansible against VPS]
  B -->|apply| D[Require confirmation text and Environment approval]
  C --> E[Summarize planned changes]
  D --> F[Verify secret presence and no-secret checks]
  F --> G{Eligibility checks pass?}
  E --> H[Exit without remote mutations]
  G -->|No| I[Stop workflow with blockers]
  G -->|Yes| J[Run apply path with baseline safety gates]
  J --> K[Collect report artifact and evidence]
  K --> L[Refresh status and report to portal]
  H --> L
  I --> L

